sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant Database
    participant TokenService
    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/login
    AuthController->>AuthService: LoginAsync(loginDto)
    AuthService->>Database: Find user by login
    Database-->>AuthService: User data
    AuthService->>AuthService: Verify password with BCrypt
    AuthService->>Database: Delete old refresh tokens
    AuthService->>TokenService: GenerateRefreshToken()
    TokenService-->>AuthService: New refresh token
    AuthService->>Database: Save new refresh token
    AuthService->>TokenService: CreateToken(user)
    TokenService-->>AuthService: JWT access token
    AuthService-->>AuthController: LoginResponseDto
    AuthController-->>Client: { accessToken, refreshToken }
